{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adyen\/dropin"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/DropIn","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the simplified checkout flow with the "},{"code":"\/sessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" endpoint does not work for you, or you prefer to have more control over the whole flow, please refer to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"AdvancedFlow.md"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Setting-up-the-Drop-in","text":"Setting up the Drop-in","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All Components need an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". An instance of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" wraps your client key, environment, payment, analytics configuration and so on.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Please read more ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.adyen.com\/development-resources\/client-side-authentication","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" about the client key and how to get one.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"Environment.test","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" during testing. When you’re ready to accept live payments, change the value to one of our ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"live environments","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"live environments","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/Environment","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We recommend creating a new context for each payment attempt."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var context: AdyenContext {","    let apiContext = try! APIContext(environment: componentsEnvironment, clientKey: clientKey)","    return AdyenContext(apiContext: apiContext,","                        payment: payment,","                        analyticsConfiguration: analyticsConfiguration)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create an instance of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenSession.Configuration"},{"type":"text","text":" with the response you received from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/sessions"},{"type":"text","text":" call and the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenContext"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let configuration = AdyenSession.Configuration(sessionIdentifier: response.sessionId,","                                               initialSessionData: response.sessionData,","                                               context: context)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call the static "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"initialize"},{"type":"text","text":" function of the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenSession","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" by providing the configuration and the delegates, which will asynchronously create and return the session instance."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["AdyenSession.initialize(with: configuration, delegate: self, presentationDelegate: self) { [weak self] result in","    switch result {","    case let .success(session):","        \/\/ store the session object","        self?.session = session","    case let .failure(error):","        \/\/ handle the error","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a configuration object for "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/DropInComponent"},{"type":"text","text":". Check specific payment method pages to confirm if you need to include additional required parameters."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Check specific payment method pages to confirm if you need to configure additional required parameters.","let dropInConfiguration = DropInComponent.Configuration()","let component = DropInComponent(paymentMethods: paymentMethods,","                                context: context,","                                configuration: dropInConfiguration)",""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some payment methods need additional configuration. For example "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/ApplePayComponent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". These payment method specific configuration parameters can be set in an instance of "},{"code":"DropInComponent.Configuration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let summaryItems = [","                      PKPaymentSummaryItem(label: \"Item A\", amount: 75, type: .final),","                      PKPaymentSummaryItem(label: \"Item B\", amount: 25, type: .final),","                      PKPaymentSummaryItem(label: \"My Company\", amount: 100, type: .final)","                   ]","let applePayment = try ApplePayPayment(countryCode: \"US\",","                                       currencyCode: \"USD\",","                                       summaryItems: summaryItems)","","let dropInConfiguration = DropInComponent.Configuration()","dropInConfiguration.applePay = .init(payment: applePayment,","                               merchantIdentifier: \"merchant.com.adyen.MY_MERCHANT_ID\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Also for voucher payment methods like Doku variants, in order for the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/DokuComponent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to enable the shopper to save the voucher, access to the shopper photos is requested, so a suitable text needs to be added to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" key in the application "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Presenting-the-Drop-in","text":"Presenting the Drop-in","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Initialize the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/DropInComponent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" class and set the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenSession","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" instance as the ","type":"text"},{"code":"delegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"partialPaymentDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (if needed) of the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/DropInComponent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" instance.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let dropInComponent = DropInComponent(paymentMethods: paymentMethods,","                                      context: context,","                                      configuration: dropInConfiguration)"," ","\/\/ Keep the Drop-in instance to avoid it being destroyed after the function is executed.","self.dropInComponent = dropInComponent"," ","\/\/ Set session as the delegate for Drop-in","dropInComponent.delegate = session","dropInComponent.partialPaymentDelegate = session"," ","present(dropInComponent.viewController, animated: true)",""]},{"typ